00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:01.773
I don't know.

00:11:01.773 --> 00:11:04.100
Let's find out because someone does that.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.068
- [Gabi] (speaking in foreign language)

00:11:06.068 --> 00:11:07.328
- [Falco] (speaking in foreign language)

00:11:07.328 --> 00:11:12.328
- [Gabi] (speaking in foreign language)

00:11:12.642 --> 00:11:17.642
- [Connie] (speaking in foreign language)

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.733
- This is so, is very gnarly.

00:11:23.768 --> 00:11:28.518
- [Man 1] (speaking in foreign language)

00:11:29.616 --> 00:11:34.366
- [Armin] (speaking in foreign language)

00:11:36.455 --> 00:11:38.622
- Actions do speak louder.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:52.130
Now who among us wouldn't be
tempted to feed a human child

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.350
