00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.470
But even if we can kind of relate

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:58.650
to what Connie is doing
here, it's clear that again,

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.060
he's in this situation

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:02.051
because he's unable to deal with the pain

00:12:02.051 --> 00:12:03.610
