00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:06.850
And this pain is led to a
plan that's not super logical

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:08.840
and is definitely not moral.

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:11.070
But you know just when
it seems like he's about

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:13.960
