doing suicide via Titan mom.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:22.060
It seems to snap Connie out
of his plan to sacrifice Falco

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:25.210
and helps him realize the
virtue of doing what's right

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:28.040
even if it doesn't directly
benefit one's passions.

